Patch P2 for the libcosmic `iced` submodule (paths are relative to iced/).
Apply with scripts/libcosmic-patched.sh, never by hand.

iced_tiny_skia: `adjust_clip_mask` zeroes only the pixels of the rectangle
last painted on the mask (remembered per thread, keyed by pixel address and
size, at most 8 masks) instead of the whole mask, and returns early when the
same rectangle is applied again and is still on the mask. The result is
byte-identical to a zeroed mask plus the stock fill. Adds its tests.

